# DYOR scheduled refresh — install with: crontab deploy/dyor-refresh.cron
#
# Weekly, Sunday 03:07 UTC. NOT daily: Santiment's free anonymous tier is ~1000
# calls/month and each token costs 2, so a 60-token refresh is 120 calls —
# weekly is ~520/month, leaving headroom for the site's on-demand analyses.
# Daily would be ~3600/month; an exhausted quota silently drops address_growth
# and dev_commit_trend, lowering coverage and shifting scores. With a Santiment
# key in /root/DYOR/.env, daily becomes affordable.
#
# The wrapper handles flock (no overlapping collectors), logging and exit codes:
#   script: /usr/local/bin/dyor-refresh   log: /var/log/dyor-refresh.log
7 3 * * 0 /usr/local/bin/dyor-refresh
